{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/migration/wave-1-tag-and-provided-in","title":"Migrating to _tag and providedIn","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"migrating-to-tag-and-providedin","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Migrating to "},{"t":"code","text":"_tag"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"providedIn"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Two renames on the public API:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// exceptions","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftException","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ code: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UserNotFound'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, payload)","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftException","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ _tag: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UserNotFound'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, payload)   ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// after","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// services","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UserApi'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", scope: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'global'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, …)","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftService","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ name: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UserApi'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", providedIn: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'global'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, …)   ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// after","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A codemod ships with this release and does most of the work:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"node","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"node_modules/@craft-ts/dev-tools/craft-migrate-errors/rename-field.mjs","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"\\"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"tsconfig.json","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--from=scope","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--to=providedIn","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"--not-with=_tag","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It is compiler-driven and AST-based: it only rewrites where "},{"t":"code","text":"tsc"},{"t":"text","text":" actually"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"breaks, and only in positions the AST confirms are the field. Run it per"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"tsconfig, then re-run until it reports "},{"t":"code","text":"clean"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"read-this-before-you-trust-a-green-build","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Read this before you trust a green build"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The dangerous part of this migration is invisible."}]},{"t":"text","text":""}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If your code reads the discriminant in a "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"value"}]},{"t":"text","text":" position, the compiler will"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"point at every site and you cannot get it wrong:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craftException","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ code: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'X'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" })   ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// errors: '_tag' is missing","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"exception.code                  ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// errors: no such property","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"If your code reads it in a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"type"}]},{"t":"text","text":" position — a conditional or an "},{"t":"code","text":"Extract"},{"t":"text","text":" —"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it does not error. It resolves to "},{"t":"code","text":"never"},{"t":"text","text":", and everything downstream quietly"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"becomes empty:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"CodesOf","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"E","kind":"type"},{"text":"> ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"E","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"extends","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"code"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"infer","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"C","kind":"type"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"C","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"never","kind":"type"},{"text":";   ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// -> never","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Only","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"E","kind":"type"},{"text":">    ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"Extract","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"E","kind":"type"},{"text":", { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"readonly","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"code"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"string","kind":"type"},{"text":" }>;      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// -> never","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"type","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"HasScope","kind":"type"},{"text":"<","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"V","kind":"type"},{"text":"> ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"V","kind":"type"},{"text":" "},{"text":"extends","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"scope"},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"unknown","kind":"type"},{"text":" } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" … "},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" …;      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// -> the else branch","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nothing fails. No test goes red. The capability just stops existing."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"This happened four times inside CraftTS itself while performing this migration,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"each caught late and by accident:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"What broke"}],[{"t":"text","text":"How it surfaced"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"text","text":"route exhaustiveness ("},{"t":"code","text":"CraftExceptionCodes"},{"t":"text","text":")"}],[{"t":"text","text":"one dev-tools test that compiles fixtures expected to FAIL"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"component exception codes"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a runtime template test, several commits later"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"settled exception codes"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a type assertion in an unrelated spec"}]],[[{"t":"text","text":"route HTTP dependency derivation"}],[{"t":"text","text":"a stale-looking assertion, chased on a hunch"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In every case the whole library suite — 1489 tests — was green."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"what-to-do-about-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What to do about it"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Run the finder before you run the codemod, and again afterwards:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"node","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"node_modules/@craft-ts/dev-tools/craft-migrate-errors/find-silent-sites.mjs","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"code","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"node","kind":"function"},{"text":" "},{"text":"node_modules/@craft-ts/dev-tools/craft-migrate-errors/find-silent-sites.mjs","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"scope","kind":"string"},{"text":" "},{"text":"src","kind":"string"}]}],"filename":"","language":"bash","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It walks the AST for the two shapes that cannot fail loudly — a conditional"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"whose "},{"t":"code","text":"extends"},{"t":"text","text":" clause reads the field, and an "},{"t":"code","text":"Extract"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"Exclude"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"Omit"},{"t":"text","text":"/"},{"t":"code","text":"Pick"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"over a literal containing it — and exits non-zero while any remain. Everything"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"it lists must be migrated "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"by hand"}]},{"t":"text","text":": the codemod cannot see them, because the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"compiler never reports them."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Ten such positions existed inside CraftTS. Four were found by accident, over"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"several days. The other six took this tool about a second."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"And keep at least one test that asserts something must "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"not"}]},{"t":"text","text":" compile"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"@ts-expect-error"},{"t":"text","text":", or a fixture your build is supposed to reject). It is the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"only kind of test that notices a guarantee disappearing."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-did-not-change","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What did NOT change"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"scope"},{"t":"text","text":" on an exception is untouched:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"craftException","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ _tag: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'UserNotFound'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", scope: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'loader'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":" }, payload)","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It says where an exception came from — an origin, not a container or a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"lifetime — so it keeps its name. Only the "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"service"}]},{"t":"text","text":" scope became "},{"t":"code","text":"providedIn"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Also unchanged: the HTTP client's "},{"t":"code","text":"{ source: 'code' }"},{"t":"text","text":" matcher and the "},{"t":"code","text":"code"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"field of a server response body. Those are the server's vocabulary, not"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"CraftTS's, and the codemod leaves them alone by construction."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"performance","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Performance"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"None of this costs anything. Measured across the rename:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"discrimination: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"6.8 ns/op"}]},{"t":"text","text":" on both sides;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"test-suite wall time: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"+0.02%"}]},{"t":"text","text":";"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"type-check instantiations on the published build: "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"−0.00%"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/effect"},{"t":"text","text":" is marginally "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"cheaper"}]},{"t":"text","text":" afterwards, because mapping an"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Effect error onto a craft exception stopped being a transposition and became"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"the identity — Effect and CraftTS now discriminate on the same field."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"read-this-before-you-trust-a-green-build","text":"Read this before you trust a green build"},{"level":3,"id":"what-to-do-about-it","text":"What to do about it"},{"level":2,"id":"what-did-not-change","text":"What did NOT change"},{"level":2,"id":"performance","text":"Performance"}]}